# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5, cuda
# Minimization in a Python simulation on a GPU (D202), scenario double of
# Inputs/python_minimize.py.
# The minimizer of `mdir run` in double precision, in several parts, against
# its last row and checkpoint, and the NVT stage after it.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_minimize.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU mdir %t double | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: GPU Double: one part of 100 steps:
# CHECK: GPU Double: 10 parts of one step after it: row at step 110 within
# CHECK: GPU Double: 30 parts of one step: row at step 30 within
# CHECK: GPU Double: NVT from the minimized state, step 10:
# CHECK: minimization double passed
